WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.000
Think about this: Which statement should
be avoided?

00:00:03.720 --> 00:00:04.780
Let’s work through it together.

00:00:05.420 --> 00:00:10.240
I'm Doctor Gainz. Lesson 9: Explain the
direct-claim option.

00:00:10.820 --> 00:00:14.800
People should understand that a government
or court process may be available

00:00:14.800 --> 00:00:19.060
directly. Explain what your business would
add, if the activity and

00:00:19.060 --> 00:00:23.740
compensation are permitted. Do not imply
you control the custodian, have an

00:00:23.740 --> 00:00:27.900
exclusive government relationship, or must
be paid before someone can

00:00:27.900 --> 00:00:29.440
inquire about their own funds.

00:00:29.440 --> 00:00:34.620
A useful consultation statement is: “The
official office describes a direct

00:00:34.620 --> 00:00:37.080
claim process. I can show you that
resource.

00:00:37.660 --> 00:00:41.860
If you want help organizing documents or
coordinating a permitted review, we

00:00:41.860 --> 00:00:46.600
can discuss the scope and any locally
reviewed terms.” Tailor facts to the

00:00:46.600 --> 00:00:51.520
actual jurisdiction; do not tell a person
that every claim is free or every

00:00:51.520 --> 00:00:56.360
case needs counsel. Invite questions and
allow time to review information.

00:00:56.960 --> 00:01:01.080
Distinguish a request for information from
a decision to retain assistance.

00:01:01.580 --> 00:01:06.320
If there is confusion about fees,
authority, or rights, pause instead of

00:01:06.320 --> 00:01:09.100
treating urgency as a reason to skip the
explanation.

00:01:09.800 --> 00:01:11.180
Pause and try this.

00:01:11.680 --> 00:01:15.240
Practice a two-minute explanation that
includes the official resource,

00:01:15.720 --> 00:01:19.720
optional assistance, unresolved facts, and
a clear next step.

00:01:20.440 --> 00:01:23.500
Quick knowledge check. Which statement
should be avoided?

00:01:24.180 --> 00:01:27.820
The answer: You must hire us to obtain
your own funds.

00:01:28.380 --> 00:01:32.720
Do not present optional assistance as a
mandatory gateway to a public claim

00:01:32.720 --> 00:01:37.180
process. Keep the source, the date, and
the unknowns visible.

00:01:37.860 --> 00:01:39.160
I'll see you in the next lesson.
